    <title>DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet - Releases - 2025-06-16</title>
    <id>https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet#2025-06-16</id>
    <link href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet" />
    <updated>2025-06-17T00:07:29Z</updated>
    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.19.0"&gt;3.19.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix recursive visibility error in duck typing (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3133918553" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7087" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7087/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7087"&gt;#7087&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix NullReferenceException in Rabbit. (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3133106680" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7083" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7083/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7083"&gt;#7083&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix exception when closing a &lt;code&gt;Span&lt;/code&gt; with null &lt;code&gt;ServiceName&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2901125552" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/6748" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6748/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6748"&gt;#6748&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Optimization] Improve git commands (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3114164031" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7050" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7050/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7050"&gt;#7050&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Enable GC CPU consumption and thread lifetime features (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3113872874" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7045" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7045/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7045"&gt;#7045&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Dynamic Instrumentation] DEBUG-4063 Add WCF support for dynamic span tags (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3140830111" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7097" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7097/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7097"&gt;#7097&lt;/a&gt;)-&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Add sampling tags during serialization (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2211034645" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/5360" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/5360/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/5360"&gt;#5360&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[tracer] fix exception when closing a &lt;code&gt;Span&lt;/code&gt; with null &lt;code&gt;ServiceName&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2901125552" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/6748" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6748/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6748"&gt;#6748&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;chore(telemetry): track whether tracing was enabled via ssi (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3047222122" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/6938" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6938/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/6938"&gt;#6938&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix &lt;code&gt;ErrorSkipTelemetry&lt;/code&gt; by changing primary file logger to sub-logger config (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3114098164" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7049" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7049/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7049"&gt;#7049&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;chore: disable data pipeline by default (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3115112296" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7055" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7055/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7055"&gt;#7055&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fix(trace-exporter): add error handling when releasing handles in ErrorHandle, TraceExporter, and TraceExporterConfiguration (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3118045593" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7061" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7061/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7061"&gt;#7061&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix recursive visibility error in duck typing (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3133918553" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7087" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7087/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7087"&gt;#7087&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Dynamic Instrumentation] DEBUG-4063 Add WCF support for dynamic span tags (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3140830111" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7097" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7097/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7097"&gt;#7097&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;CI Visibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Optimization] Improve git commands (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3114164031" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7050" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7050/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7050"&gt;#7050&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
